{
  "dom_id": "step-e3505",
  "name": "Example: Identifying the Equation of a Cosine Function With a Phase Shift",
  "problem": "Which of the following could be the equation of the graph shown below?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14255079/assets/e6967b5b4549651185daa1a8096f33d1c665e95e96e0c068af395551443dd6ae.png)",
  "worked_solution": "Let's add the graph of $y=\\cos x$ to the plot.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14255079/assets/a5a30db212eae205e6045a4956ba04321e602d74920af2cd45a074609a0ccfb3.png)\n\nTo plot the given curve, we follow these steps:\n\n- Start with the graph of $y=\\cos x.$\n\n- Then, shift it by $3$ unit **left.**\n\nTherefore, the given graph is $y = \\cos\\left(x+3\\right).$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e3505\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Identifying the Equation of a Cosine Function With a Phase Shift</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e3505\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <p>Which of the following could be the equation of the graph shown below?</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-72003560d037ff9dbe72d9e4b228fdcf\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/72003560d037ff9dbe72d9e4b228fdcf\"></div>\n                    </div>     \n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                           